5d5e4cfb-fc5f-4bb6-b27b-9b81ec073b60	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	4b89b645-fd27-442f-9f27-7655e95abb81	Ashley Forestier	asheforestier@gmail.com	3374653641	home_visit	I’m a mom of 2 (6yr and 2yr), I work from home, my boyfriend works 12 hour shifts outside of the home. We have been talking about getting a dog as a family pet for a few weeks now and this one looks so kind and sweet, and both me and my bf are big game of thrones fans so when we saw the name it was definitely eye catching. 	{"01aca03e-789a-4460-b40d-0449f3804b7d": "Yes, adults have discussed. Kids don't know yet.", "064dde9a-f39b-4ecf-b5bb-2d55f81413f9": ["As a family pet", "As a companion for my child/children"], "0ac0cb57-13ca-4592-ba8a-9fc75b37b5e9": "$30,001-$50,000", "0b5c3628-fc18-4199-8916-ccfa8b70212a": "No", "10c5666b-1291-4684-9ec0-9acb4843fce5": "We plan to use care vet of bayou teche breaux bridge ", "18eec34d-8fa0-4a93-8d7b-c491df6538ca": "Purina one", "2671d548-56a6-4178-a4ba-065e77ce974a": "Medium energy, plays a bit then hangs out with you", "26d085dc-9d08-45c9-9d9a-64f9b908dc9f": "Ashley Forestier (28)\\nNicolas Theriot (23)\\nTai Forestier (6)\\nLiliana Theriot (2)", "29b8d405-2b4f-4525-96c3-dbca38f47b24": ["Be kept indoors most of the time", "Be kept inside while we are away", "Have free reign of the house when we are not home", "Take frequent car rides with us", "Be taken to formal obedience classes", "Be mostly interacting with adults", "Be interacting frequently with children under 8", "Will be housetrained by us", "Will be walked more than one mile per day every day", "Be taking frequent car rides/trips with us", "Be attending formal group obedience classes with us", "Stay with family when we go on vacation", "Be going camping with us"], "2c5dcb0d-673f-4e34-b907-79d0c28477c3": "If it was aggressive towards the children. Not playful excited jumping, that’s to be expected, but like aggressive aggressive. ", "3669d749-48e1-4861-818f-b4409d1b529c": "No, I am only interested in this particular dog", "3aa4dcb4-3823-4973-be90-66f74e88a85b": "Usually none, maybe alone 2-3 hours a month. I work from home and have anxiety about going most places alone so I get groceries and what not delivered to our house. ", "50246d03-f53a-4d74-ab1d-e628ee355b9c": "Yes", "50c3fd12-6cc4-4b58-a77f-37246171a866": "I just fell in love with his picture and I’m all in for adoption as of right now, if he won’t be a good match then I am open to one you think might be, he has such a sweet face and I can tell he’s ready for a bunch of love", "5c8271b6-2ab3-4b4c-be53-dde812ae5b38": "No", "69215745-8d7c-432b-ab46-9d34cbd60971": "6 months, I believe it’ll take about 6 months before the dog is completely comfortable with a family ", "69241e46-edd1-458b-bfaf-58eec727d35c": "No", "6cbe621d-e9d3-4e1e-a6f5-1896f2e64743": "All dogs have to be walked on a leash\\nAll dogs must have a rabies vaccine with the proof\\nAll dogs considered dangerous must be microchipped with a red collar\\nAll dogs must have adequate shelter, food, and water provided by owner", "6f281351-1b1e-4f95-b2fe-d5cea2aa2f96": "I’m unsure", "71aef581-5951-4267-a5b1-0b472e753d9c": "Cell", "77d04357-496d-42d2-9dce-f7141f689ffa": "Single Family Home", "783a285a-089b-49c8-9053-deed177a1623": "1-21-2026", "7a156ee7-fc8a-445b-aed1-2082cc3cc58c": "Do what I can, crowd fund if I have to", "7aa52ba6-a6fb-4a34-ac93-a3e0ea06d12d": "800-1,000 square feet", "7cb0047c-af9b-43f3-b918-62b8b18d5901": "Yes", "83232f92-f4a7-4a70-a365-6ceb38a37b3b": "Nicolas Theriot", "860e5aa6-4f03-4d21-8b5e-e6d7f5bd432a": "Aggression towards children. Not rough playfulness, actual aggression. ", "87b593af-150f-4aa4-9745-46ab289540c2": "No", "8c8f11f4-b4e5-4765-bc37-c68bc17b5706": "705 Edward st, Breaux bridge, La, 70517\\n\\n\\n3374653641", "8de69b5b-d475-4ab7-9228-279359f337f1": "Yes", "90cd5ddf-e73b-4a37-9252-658074250af9": "One applicant is home/works from home", "a3f184dc-f37a-4fed-aea4-8c0436677f96": "10000", "a5611bee-8465-4388-a626-21bcf