2df6835a-909f-4b44-8376-216de106f882	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	Our History	The Haseya's Team first took over the Rayne Animal Shelter in February of 2020. Since then, we have been dedicated to helping the needs of all stray dogs. Haseya's maintains a "no-kill" status by never euthanizing for space and constantly working to adopt and transport rescued animals. \n\nTo be a "no-kill" shelter you must have at least a 90% live release rate. 	0	t	{"fontSize": "1rem", "textAlign": "center", "fontFamily": "inherit", "showBorder": true, "imagePosition": "below", "backgroundColor": "#dbfaf7", "backgroundImage": "/objects/3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051/animal-photos/16a4df36-6222-4f53-8ec0-234377d1340d"}	c9f80047-4456-426b-9ee8-d1b15f7301b9	c9f80047-4456-426b-9ee8-d1b15f7301b9	2026-01-04 17:09:33.532588	2026-01-05 00:50:34.304
487ef681-7093-42bb-8410-d0dde6e9db30	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	Our Mission	The purpose of Haseya’s New Beginning is to form a passionate team of individuals dedicated to helping animals that need us the most, including the sick, the starving, the Wild, the weak, and the unwanted. We want to take the biggest challenges that seem impossible, with God by our side, and make them possible by providing each one with medical care, a proper diet, love, and most importantly, a New Beginning.	0	t	{"fontSize": "1rem", "textAlign": "center", "fontFamily": "inherit", "showBorder": true, "imagePosition": "below", "backgroundColor": "#dbfaf7", "backgroundImage": "/objects/3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051/animal-photos/fefdfc45-893d-4dfa-aa97-62e4ecea51a3"}	c9f80047-4456-426b-9ee8-d1b15f7301b9	c9f80047-4456-426b-9ee8-d1b15f7301b9	2026-01-04 17:11:44.349202	2026-01-05 01:13:07.499
