f8112b9c-1455-4229-8686-0700a3618a29	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	1c94d33d-5596-47cf-9fb2-11696a86dbb6	\N	Robby	rstelly3@gmail.com	\N	{"horse_age": "7 years", "horse_name": "Bud", "signer_zip": "70506", "horse_breed": "Arabian", "signer_city": "Lafayette", "horse_gender": "male", "horse_height": "48 inches", "signer_state": "LA", "horse_description": "jet black with white hooves", "signer_address_street": "107 Dumaine St."}	data:image/png;base64,	2026-01-19 20:45:29.202	76.72.71.88, 34.111.179.208, 35.191.75.208,136.119.30.108	/objects/forms/form_1768855592166_81kc7c.pdf	\n\n<div class="container">\n\n    <h1>Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue Equine Adoption Agreement</h1>\n\n    <p>This agreement is made between <strong>Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue</strong> and <strong>Robby</strong>, hereby referred to as "Adopter."</p>\n\n    <p>Adopter agrees to adopt and care for the following equine for the purpose of providing a safe, healthy, and loving environment for the horse and will abide by all anti-cruelty laws of the state in which the animal will reside.</p>\n\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group full-width">\n            A. Name of horse:\n            <div class="input-box">Bud</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            B. Age of horse/DOB:\n            <div class="input-box">7 years</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            C. Gender of horse:\n            <div class="input-box">male</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            D. Approximate Height:\n            <div class="input-box">48 inches</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            E. Breed:\n            <div class="input-box">Arabian</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-group full-width">\n        F. Description (brands, scars, tattoos, disabilities):\n        <div class="input-box">jet black with white hooves</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <p class="warning-text">\n        I, as the adopter of this equine, agree to NEVER, UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES, SELL, REHOME, GIVE AWAY, LET ANY PERSON BORROW, the said equine, at any time during the equine's life. EQUINE MUST BE RETURNED TO Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue IMMEDIATELY.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class="signature-block">\n        Signature of Adopter\n        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Signature" class="signature-image">\n        <div class="meta-info">Signed by: Robby | IP: 76.72.71.88, 34.111.179.208, 35.191.75.208,136.119.30.108 | 2026-01-19T20:45:29.199Z</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>Required Level of Care</h2>\n    <p>The level of care of Adoption Horses should be the highest standards in the industry.</p>\n    \n    <h3>Required Veterinarian Care:</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Spring Inoculations:</strong> Eastern/Western Encephalitis, Tetanus, Rabies, and any others recommended by your vet.</li>\n        <li><strong>Annual Dental Care:</strong> (floating of teeth).</li>\n        <li><strong>Fall Inoculations:</strong> Influenza, Rhino, and any others recommended by your vet, and dental (may be combined).</li>\n        <li><strong>Deworming &amp; Hoof Care:</strong> Rotated de-worming as recommended by Veterinarian. Hoof care every 8 weeks.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Housing &amp; Environment:</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Horses are herd animals and are happiest when they have an equine companion. Horses will not be adopted out to a home without another horse.</li>\n        <li>The horse must have daily turnout of no less than 8 hours unless there is dangerous weather.</li>\n        <li>The horse must have at least one acre of clear-cut pasture with some shade per horse.</li>\n        <li>The horse must have at least a 3-sided shed in the paddock to block wind and bad weather. Preference is given to anyone that has an individual stall for each horse.</li>\n        <li>Your pasture must have acceptable fencing.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Feeding &amp; Maintenance:</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Each horse must receive the required daily feed allowance plus plenty of good quality grass or hay.</li>\n        <li>Each horse must be offered no less than 15 gallons of fresh water each day, either in buckets or in regularly cleaned out water troughs. A stagnant pond or creek is not an acceptable primary source of water.</li>\n        <li>The horse must be trimmed or shod by a qualified farrier, going no longer than every 8 weeks.</li>\n        <li>Miniature horses should not hold more than 50 pounds of body weight.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Adopter Responsibilities</h2>\n    <p>Adopter agrees to contact <strong>Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue</strong> for the following reasons:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>If Adopter can no longer care for the horse.</li>\n        <li>If the horse dies.</li>\n        <li>If the horse becomes seriously injured or ill.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>A vet is to be called for any illness and any serious injury. If a diagnosis of injury or illness cannot be treated due to financial reasons, the horse must be returned to Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue immediately.</p>\n    \n    <p>It is advised that the adopter pay for a vet check if you have any questions prior to the horse departing Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue. All costs upon departing and while away are to be paid by the Adopter, even return transportation. Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue is not responsible for any accidents or injuries either to the horse or adopter after leaving our facility.</p>\n\n    <p>The adopted horse can be returned to Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue at any time, regardless of reason, if you can no longer provide a loving, forever home. <strong>The adoption donation will not be refunded.</strong></p>\n\n    <div class="field-row" style="background-color: #eee; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">\n        <div class="full-width">\n            <strong>* Adoption Donation:</strong> Concurrent with the Signature of this agreement, Adopter has paid to Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue a non-refundable adoption donation in the amount of:\n            <br><br>\n            <div class="input-box" style="width: 150px; display: inline-block;">{{adoption_fee}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <p>Full payment of the adoption donation is required before removal of the adopted horse from Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue facility.</p>\n\n    <p class="warning-text">Prohibited Uses: ADOPTER AGREES THAT UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHALL THE ADOPTED HORSE BE USED FOR BREEDING PURPOSES.</p>\n\n    <div class="signature-block">\n        Signature of Adopter\n        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Signature" class="signature-image">\n        <div class="meta-info">Signed by: Robby | IP: 76.72.71.88, 34.111.179.208, 35.191.75.208,136.119.30.108 | 2026-01-19T20:45:29.199Z</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>Disclosure and Release</h2>\n    <p>Adopter represents, warrants, and declares that Adopter is aware of the following in connection with his/her adoption of the adopted horse from Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>A. That horses are different from human beings in the response to human actions.</li>\n        <li>B. That the actions of horses are often unpredictable.</li>\n        <li>C. That horses should be closely and carefully supervised when they are with or around children.</li>\n        <li>D. That the Adopted horse's behavior may change after it leaves Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue.</li>\n        <li>E. That horses in a new environment may act differently and Adopter will afford the horse adequate time (at least 7 days) to acclimate to its new environment before being ridden, to the extent the horse is rideable.</li>\n        <li>F. That any statements made by Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue regarding the adopted horse are merely opinions and are made solely as a courtesy, and in no way amount to claims, representations, or warranties as to temperament, health, or mental disposition.</li>\n        <li>G. Adopter releases, discharges, indemnifies and holds Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue harmless from and against any and all claims, liens, damages, losses, and causes of action which may be asserted by Adopter and all third parties for injury or damage to all persons, property, or thing whatsoever caused directly or indirectly by the adopted horse.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class="signature-block">\n        Signature of Adopter\n        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Signature" class="signature-image">\n        <div class="meta-info">Signed by: Robby | IP: 76.72.71.88, 34.111.179.208, 35.191.75.208,136.119.30.108 | 2026-01-19T20:45:29.199Z</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>Final Agreement</h2>\n    <p>Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue holds the right to recover the horse(s) if ever abused, abandoned, neglected, starved, or mistreated, etc., in any way. The Adopter agrees to abide by the Required Level of Care, or the horse can and will be recovered by Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue at any time. Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue reserves the right to visit the equine at one month, six months, and one year with 48 hours advance notice to the adopter.</p>\n\n    <p><strong>I have read and understand the conditions of the Adoption Contract and agree to uphold the highest level of care for my Adopted horse.</strong></p>\n\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            First Name\n            <div class="input-box">Robby</div> </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            Date\n            <div class="input-box">January 19, 2026</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group full-width">\n            Street Address\n            <div class="input-box">107 Dumaine St.</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group full-width">\n            Address Line 2\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_address_line2}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            City\n            <div class="input-box">Lafayette</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            State / Province\n            <div class="input-box">LA</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            Postal / Zip Code\n            <div class="input-box">70506</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            Phone Number\n            <div class="input-box"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            Email\n            <div class="input-box">rstelly3@gmail.com</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class="signature-block">\n        Final Signature\n        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Signature" class="signature-image">\n        <div class="meta-info">\n            Digital Signature: data:image/png;base64,<br>\n            Timestamp: 2026-01-19T20:45:29.199Z<br>\n            IP Address: 76.72.71.88, 34.111.179.208, 35.191.75.208,136.119.30.108\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n	2026-01-19 20:41:13.435	\N	bc9ac07416816c70c747f1c5351d35d708f1f439eb336b038fbcb4846bc1f3f8	2026-01-22 20:41:12.807	completed	2026-01-19 20:41:12.817564	2026-01-19 20:46:55.667	\N	\N	f	f	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	not_required	\N	\N	\N
