, "order": 13, "question": "If yes, what are your plans for your pets if you move?", "required": false}, {"id": "bd32984a-93eb-4885-8716-22f29ac4d679", "type": "checkbox", "order": 14, "question": "Do you own your own home?", "required": true}, {"id": "c6f9d512-ac87-4920-8c8e-df04a3f00086", "type": "textarea", "order": 15, "question": "If no, name and phone # of landlord:", "required": false}, {"id": "7b1148e0-4423-4065-abaa-fd2672a11c0d", "type": "select", "order": 16, "options": ["House", "Apartment", "Condo", "Mobile Home"], "question": "Type of Dwelling:", "required": true}, {"id": "ae2f09db-1128-433a-b3c9-8ff37658782d", "type": "textarea", "order": 17, "question": "Name and age of ALL occupants in household (including yourself)", "required": true}, {"id": "fcaf3e0e-381b-4ce9-a9d9-4ca8a1f6e7c8", "type": "multiselect", "order": 18, "options": ["House pet", "Mouse patrol", "Companion", "Companion for pet", "Gift", "Other"], "question": "What is your reason for wanting to adopt a cat?", "required": true}, {"id": "933afee4-87ea-45a7-8bbb-99ea960e69df", "type": "textarea", "order": 19, "question": "If Other, please specify", "required": false}, {"id": "51eee964-de33-4783-a826-2526c4335216", "type": "textarea", "order": 20, "question": "How many total hours will your new pet be left alone during the day?", "required": true}, {"id": "234dbe27-c0d3-4a99-912e-3039087de10f", "type": "textarea", "order": 21, "question": "If adopting a kitten, where would the kitten be kept when alone?", "required": false}, {"id": "a5082c5d-73a5-4830-a16f-17ff65fe1371", "type": "radio", "order": 23, "options": ["Yes", "No", "N/A"], "question": "Are your current cats declawed?", "required": true}, {"id": "376089b3-500c-4161-a169-edb3d88000e5", "type": "checkbox", "order": 30, "question": "Have you ever lost or given away a pet?", "required": true}, {"id": "44cac120-aa19-415a-816e-5abc00fc3486", "type": "textarea", "order": 31, "question": "If you currently own a dog or cat, how does he/she react to new cats?", "required": false}, {"id": "b9327d10-fa49-4ebc-a14a-244ac3d104d1", "type": "select", "order": 32, "options": ["yes", "no", "N/A"], "question": "Are your present pets up-to-date on their annual vaccines?", "required": true}, {"id": "8371844c-42bb-4faf-b5e8-8632ef4d019e", "type": "textarea", "order": 33, "question": "If no, please explain:", "required": false}, {"id": "a836f83f-f62a-402c-a262-6d1c310ce70f", "type": "select", "order": 34, "options": ["yes", "no", "N/A"], "question": "Are your present pets spayed or neutered?", "required": true}, {"id": "11a94ec7-babf-4b1a-bef6-5d74106db08d", "type": "textarea", "order": 35, "question": "If no, please explain.", "required": false}, {"id": "149aee3d-11a6-492c-bfa7-8a3b663f20c8", "type": "select", "order": 36, "options": ["yes", "no", "N/A"], "question": "Were your previous pets spayed or neutered?", "required": true}, {"id": "f069c039-344a-4dce-81f3-c17b70d7e566", "type": "textarea", "order": 37, "question": "If no, please explain", "required": false}, {"id": "f415e661-2550-4ae2-a883-4c1264ae3071", "type": "textarea", "order": 38, "question": "How much are you financially prepared to spend for routine/emergency medical care, licensing, etc?", "required": true}, {"id": "48dfbdef-49c8-4dcf-8b36-bdd056280cc9", "type": "textarea", "order": 39, "question": "What plans do you have for your new pet when you are on vacation?", "required": true}, {"id": "e7e5d2bf-f21a-4b65-9ea1-bd25900d3db1", "type": "textarea", "order": 40, "question": "Which cat(s) are you interested in?", "required": true}, {"id": "e7b232bf-a3a9-4b32-89dd-a431283ef16c", "type": "multiselect", "order": 41, "options": ["kitten", "young", "adult", "special needs", "senior"], "question": "Age of cat you would consider adopting: (check all that apply)", "required": true}, {"id": "b5c69509-7c11-4ae7-88ab-972d5ff74d4a", "type": "checkbox", "order": 42, "question": "Can/Will you provide your cat with monthly flea/tick prevention?", "required": true}, {"id": "6d56fa45-76ba-4e74-a7dc-2330ae5ab117", "type": "textarea", "order": 43, "question": "Who is your current or most recent veterinarian? Please provide their NAME and PHONE NUMBER: PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU CALL YOUR VET TO GIVE PERMISSION TO RELEASE INFORMATION AS MANY WILL NOT GIVE US A REFERENCE W/OUT YOUR CALL, AND WE WILL NOT BE ABLE TO PROCESS YOUR APPLICATION", "required": true}, {"id": "03900de6-4c9d-449a-8f0c-6193b0eeaed8", "type": "multiselect", "order": 44, "options": ["contact a professional", "use a book", "personal knowledge", "other"], "question": "If your cat displays behavioral problems (such as poor litter box habits, inappropriate scratching etc.) how would you go about correcting the behavior?", "required": true}, {"id": "808ae04a-50b6-40a7-8345-4baa3e9495aa", "type": "textarea", "order": 45, "question": "if other, please explain", "required": false}, {"id": "f7fee6d6-7665-43a9-9949-a3706bbab9ad", "type": "multiselect", "order": 46, "options": ["move box to new location", "try different litter", "clean box more often", "have cat examined by vet", "use a cat door", "return cat", "none", "other"], "question": "What type of solution would you be willing to try if housebreaking accidents continue after the first week (check all that apply)?", "required": true}, {"id": "c8d94a03-2a49-45cc-b23f-1bdb6f937fa4", "type": "text", "order": 47, "question": "if other, please explain:", "required": false}, {"id": "017a084b-0c85-4ae3-97dc-32339b36ea80", "type": "text", "order": 48, "question": "What brand of cat food do you plan on feeding your new cat?", "required": true}, {"id": "98f0a8fe-be39-424a-ba8b-e25cd30bdf1a", "type": "checkbox", "order": 49, "question": "Is your entire immediate family in agreement with the decision to bring a new pet into your home?", "required": true}, {"id": "f93d398b-e102-4bd6-b620-361c9243a8cc", "type": "textarea", "order": 50, "question": "If anyone is NOT, please explain:", "required": false}, {"id": "0d932b5e-9e0c-414a-8708-10fbcb09a5ae", "type": "checkbox", "order": 51, "question": "Are you prepared to commit to a pet for 15 - 20 years (average life span)?", "required": true}, {"id": "f03a5c1e-1a65-40e3-9ce6-46b625df0b91", "type": "checkbox", "order": 52, "question": "Have you or any member of your household ever been charged with cruelty to animals or negligence in animal care?", "required": true}, {"id": "5ea1e475-8a8b-4206-9ff3-ce1efbf456b2", "type": "textarea", "order": 53, "question": "If yes, please describe:", "required": false}, {"id": "e3c65ec3-e544-40e2-8afe-d7a10f106ca0", "type": "select", "order": 54, "options": ["indoors only", "outdoors only", "indoors & outdoors", "barn cat", "basement/garage", "confined"], "question": "Where will your cat spend most of his/her time?", "required": true}, {"id": "708b2cea-81ad-4f05-a4c5-03d20e09bf85", "type": "checkbox", "order": 55, "question": "If you selected outdoor, would your cat be supervised?", "required": false}, {"id": "913f9c32-bb03-43ce-9c2f-e46bda5c052c", "type": "textarea", "order": 56, "question": "Where will your cat sleep?", "required": true}, {"id": "7f13a594-0346-4c1a-a9aa-ba3096bdfb8a", "type": "info", "order": 57, "infoText": "Please provide 3 personal references (only 1 can be a relative) that can testify to your responsibility and ability to care for your animals. This is required or your application cannot be approved. PLEASE BE AWARE: If your references are not easily reachable or do not reply in a timely manner, it will delay your application. If multiple references do not reply, your application will be filed on HOLD. Please choose your references carefully and be sure to list the correct contact numbers.", "question": "****", "required": false}, {"id": "40fa0bf5-096b-49d1-aab8-30855f704c44", "type": "textarea", "order": 58, "question": "Reference #1 (first and last name and relationship to self)", "required": true}, {"id": "b75f0ec1-089d-440b-9e7e-7cf0e3c1c5b5", "type": "phone", "order": 59, "question": "Reference 1 phone number", "required": true}, {"id": "31dc28f0-65b9-4088-ab83-1a255ea58b50", "type": "textarea", "order": 60, "question": "Reference #2 (first and last name and relationship to self)", "required": true}, {"id": "e2a120eb-2238-4d77-84b6-8d4b74cb9be2", "type": "phone", "order": 61, "question": "Reference #2 phone number", "required": true}, {"id": "cfb61d23-8cca-42d4-a215-3382d57b89f9", "type": "textarea", "order": 62, "question": "Reference #3 (first and last name and relationship to self)", "required": true}, {"id": "262807c1-c016-45ac-bb7e-98c6c3119abf", "type": "phone", "order": 63, "question": "Reference #3 phone number", "required": true}, {"id": "b1549dfe-a71c-41d6-8296-178901345b00", "type": "textarea", "order": 65, "question": "If there is anything else you think we should know, please note it here.", "required": false}, {"id": "b9dc96ee-9473-4948-82aa-70b0a0114685", "type": "multiselect", "order": 68, "options": ["alone", "spouse", "parents", "children", "roommate"], "question": "Who do you live with?", "required": true}, {"id": "b25bb1a4-a767-4ad2-b2a3-05d5b220d0d1", "type": "text", "order": 69, "question": "Who will be the primary caregiver of the cat?", "required": true}, {"id": "517908b6-aaad-4354-9958-1ee1401cefd9", "type": "textarea", "order": 70, "question": "Your veterinarian’s name and clinic name. If you currently do not have a vet, please list a vet you plan to use or have used in the past", "required": true}, {"id": "e4a1ac4e-ca98-4b7d-9997-a8e51d5dcf97", "type": "textarea", "order": 71, "question": "Your Veterinarian’s Clinic’s Address", "required": true}, {"id": "ce734d55-888e-4821-9c6d-77668f893cb5", "type": "phone", "order": 72, "question": "Veterinarian’s Clinic’s Phone Number", "required": true}, {"id": "84d65d29-b831-4c80-b181-311fca3302a1", "type": "checkbox", "order": 73, "question": "If you are renting, have you checked with your landlord to be sure pets are allowed and that you have a pet deposit?", "required": false}, {"id": "bec2d743-f42c-46c5-8e2e-6962cf8091f1", "type": "textarea", "order": 74, "question": "Do you or any of the people you live with have allergies to cats? If yes, how do you plan to cope with the allergies?", "required": false}, {"id": "c2e34a09-e72d-4132-9f17-12f2ab6a0134", "type": "text", "order": 75, "question": "If outdoors, how long after adoption would you start allowing your cat to go out?", "required": false}, {"id": "77c61c62-890f-4093-8c08-f96f0a98ba12", "type": "textarea", "order": 76, "question": "What steps will you take if your cat goes missing?", "required": true}, {"id": "3e9ab1a3-8282-43bd-97b6-5603da9f18a3", "type": "textarea", "order": 77, "question": "Please list all animals you  have owned in the past 5 years and if you still own them. If not, why?", "required": true}, {"id": "af5b5afe-86fd-44b9-937e-7b293b5979da", "type": "textarea", "order": 78, "question": "Are all animals in the home altered, if no, please provide reason for EACH animal", "required": true}, {"id": "71d81565-4b73-4e84-845d-027e1dd1aaea", "type": "textarea", "order": 79, "question": "Have you ever rehomed (or attempted to rehome) and animal, if so when and why?", "required": true}, {"id": "cbed907a-d438-417b-9ce0-3bf88717649f", "type": "checkbox", "order": 80, "question": "I understand that cats and kittens adopted through Haseya’s New Beginning will be spayed/neutered (funded by rescue) and will not be declawed.", "required": true}, {"id": "95841ba6-ccd7-40c8-b337-90e76747ff67", "type": "checkbox", "order": 81, "question": "Please read and sign: Many factors determine which applicant will be matched with a particular pet. If you are not able to adopt a pet today, it does not mean that you are not considered a good pet owner or that your home is not acceptable. Our goal is to place all animals into homes that will best suit their individual needs. Please ask for clarification if you have any questions. Have you completed this application truthfully and fully understand the adoption process?", "required": true}, {"id": "5740d330-b94b-430f-862b-c1994308a7a7", "type": "date", "order": 82, "question": "Today's Date", "required": true}]	
