nHaseya’s will assess the physical and behavioral health of the animals adoptibility.\\nIf you subsequently call about the animals status, you may not be given any follow up information about the animal except whether it is or is not at the shelter. \\n\\nI, undersigned, owner or having control of the animal described above, hereby give ownership of said animal to Haseyas adoption center to be placed for adoption or rescue \\n\\n\\nI assume all responsibility for damages caused during my ownership of said animal. I agree to make all veterinarian records for said animal available to shelter and or adopter of said animal. \\n\\nI certify, to my knowledge this animal has not bitten anyone in the last 10 days, or has been exposed to rabies. \\n\\n\\n I understand and agree that the shelter reserves the right to place this animal in a foster home, or adoption.", "question": "***************************************************************", "required": false}, {"id": "15a7c05f-0756-43fd-8fdd-a9b4b6cf9c18", "type": "text", "order": 14, "question": "Print Name", "required": true}]	
e86f1539-b55b-4baf-989a-83679a2f6e89	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	Haseya’s New Beginning Cat Adoption Agreement		standalone		t	t	f	\N	2026-01-19 19:36:46.587828	2026-01-19 20:17:31.84	c9f80047-4456-426b-9ee8-d1b15f7301b9	[]	question_builder	[{"id": "dbe08c7d-be0b-45e9-a2c6-733f589bea31", "type": "text", "order": 0, "question": "Full Name", "required": true}, {"id": "382f87e3-f90c-40cc-9ea4-23e1bbb0986d", "type": "email", "order": 1, "question": "Email", "required": true}, {"id": "2385e327-281f-43b6-a3b7-b074f1132356", "type": "text", "order": 2, "question": "Street Address", "required": true}, {"id": "12f823ca-ab73-4e94-b870-7d661bf0d938", "type": "text", "order": 3, "question": "Street Address (line 2)", "required": false}, {"id": "eff7a657-aa25-4e96-9bc7-d40f337b88f2", "type": "text", "order": 4, "question": "City", "required": true}, {"id": "c2f01cdd-f072-46e7-a6a2-0400520dceb9", "type": "text", "order": 5, "question": "State", "required": false}, {"id": "c9725b1d-99c5-4723-980d-15421fb7f5db", "type": "number", "order": 6, "question": "Zip Code", "required": true}, {"id": "9e390c67-61b8-4e65-93b3-fbddb0d77f54", "type": "number", "order": 7, "question": "Age", "required": false}, {"id": "9fdfcd90-95ee-458b-991e-0cc21d11f822", "type": "number", "order": 8, "question": "Home Phone Number", "required": false}, {"id": "1ef87aa2-c7ba-4b3c-b76a-013063abffc0", "type": "number", "order": 9, "question": "Cell Phone Number", "required": false}, {"id": "8d199777-5abe-4b38-8ed0-8976076dc3ce", "type": "number", "order": 10, "question": "Work Phone Number", "required": false}, {"id": "eff60f7e-e342-436b-ad3c-192b31050303", "type": "info", "order": 11, "infoText": "Regarding the cat you are adopting please describe as follows:", "question": "Regarding the cat you are adopting please describe as follows:", "required": false}, {"id": "39a72c01-7374-4254-a176-a2678be3784d", "type": "text", "order": 12, "question": "Name of Cat you are adopting:", "required": true}, {"id": "0b4d833e-5238-449e-9e39-67d2d34855f3", "type": "text", "order": 13, "question": "Age of Cat you are adopting:", "required": false}, {"id": "c058f298-d8cc-450e-b115-76771905092a", "type": "select", "order": 14, "options": ["Male", "Female"], "question": "Sex of Cat you are adopting:", "required": true}, {"id": "69845573-432e-49f5-9b8b-70ba7650f1ca", "type": "text", "order": 15, "question": "Breed/Color of Cat you are adopting:", "required": true}, {"id": "68d48820-c95e-4a22-a8fd-5da3bc9bb5df", "type": "text", "order": 16, "question": "Description of Cat you are adopting:", "required": true}, {"id": "b67fe980-b816-4018-b0ce-b60496ae47c8", "type": "info", "order": 17, "infoText": "By adopting this cat from Haseya’s New Beginning you are agreeing to these requirements:", "question": "-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------", "required": false}, {"id": "e9dc6790-54d0-437e-9efe-aa0fb3eb58c8", "type": "info", "order": 18, "infoText": "1. Cats are to live in a private residence as companion animals. \\n\\n2. I will provide the cat with sufficient quantities of nutritious food and fresh water DAILY. \\n\\n3. I will NEVER strike or cause harm to the cat.\\n\\n4. I will NEVER have the cat declawed. \\n\\n5. I will bring the cat to it's spay or neuter appointment when Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue gives me the date/time if they are not spayed or neutered prior to adoption\\n\\n6. I will keep the cat up to date on its vaccinations for rabies and distemper \\n\\n7. I will bring the cat to the vet upon sickness, disease, or injury \\n\\n8. If the cat must be relinquished for any reason, you must NOT rehome the cat, you must bring the cat back to Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue\\n\\n9. I understand that failure to perform the foregoing agreement will constitute a breach of contract, I authorize Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue to reclaim possession of the adopted cat.", "question": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------", "required": false}, {"id": "8da9bbdf-667f-4ca3-a0a0-87f16ebdddb2", "type": "info", "order": 19, "infoText": "By sending this form electronically, I acknowledge that I have completely read this questionnaire and comprehend it fully. I understand that failure to comply with the requirements of this application can result in the forfeiture of any Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue Cat(s). I certify that the above information is correct, and I understand that the information will be verified. I understand that by submitting this form electronically, I agree to release and covenant to hold harmless Haseya's New Beginning and it's members from any claims, damages, costs, or actions incurred because of the care or actions of the adopted cat(s). I accept full responsibility for the cat(s) actions at all times, and release Haseya's New Beginning from any liabilities or damages that may be incurred because of adopting such cat(s). I agree that if I'm unable to keep the cat(s) anymore that I will return the cat(s) to Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue and try to give Haseya's New Beginning Animal Rescue a 2 week period to try and find another suitable foster/home for the cat(s).", "question": "-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------", "required": false}, {"id": "199fb317-67a0-4f01-99e1-e0904e851d0f", "type": "date", "order": 20, "question": "Today's Date", "required": true}, {"id": "12e8e5d8-fb13-4ff2-8cbd-65df5bdc18e1", "type": "text", "order": 21, "question": "Your Name", "required": true}]	
d3d2ad5f-4552-4bcc-920c-6fa3de64ca9a	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	Haseyas New Beginning Feral Cat spay/neuter Request Form		standalone		f	t	f	\N	2026-01-19 20:22:54.226653	2026-01-19 20:22:54.226653	c9f80047-4456-426b-9ee8-d1b15f7301b9	[]	question_builder	[{"id": "26c8b080-cb77-44e7-9b5e-789159feb45a", "type": "text", "order": 0, "question": "First Name", "required": true}, {"id": "1a8901e4-a5d6-463d-8368-de79e461cc4c", "type": "text", "order": 1, "question": "Last Name", "required": true}, {"id": "15d68556-7f8a-4f03-8458-3341feac00c7", "type": "text", "order": 2, "question": "Street Address", "required": true}, {"id": "d3fb3eed-2198-425f-8a8c-31a5342610a8", "type": "text", "order": 3, "question": "Street Address (line 2)", "required": false}, {"id": "07ec2321-3a2f-46a9-b777-dfff82632123", "type": "text", "order": 4, "question": "City", "required": true}, {"id": "3b6ffd46-ebbe-4f55-99c7-256ebcc7e5fd", "type": "text", "order": 5, "question": "State", "required": true}, {"id": "5deb3f8f-c46a-4ea7-a0ea-a5e57ab2815f", "type": "number", "order": 6, "question": "Zip code", "required": true}, {"id": "456dd77e-ad0b-4fc1-9f15-ddc6fed541cf", "type": "phone", "order": 7, "question": "Phone Number", "required": true}, {"id": "c5a76b3a-0f82-44b7-a894-e854da19fc6d", "type": "checkbox", "order": 8, "question": "Are the cats completely feral?", "required": true}, {"id": "44b279fa-bd31-476f-b63a-5bfbeff38f53", "type": "number", "order": 9, "question": "How many feral cats do you have?", "required": true}, {"id": "cc7d68a6-2ba7-4750-a133-132a98564812", "type": "file", "order": 10, "question": "Please download a photo of your drivers license. You must live in the city limits of Rayne.", "required": true}]	
1c94d33d-5596-47cf-9fb2-11696a86dbb6	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	HNBAR Equine Adoption Agreement		standalone	\n\n<div class="container">\n\n    <h1>{{organization_name}} Equine Adoption Agreement</h1>\n\n    <p>This agreement is made between <strong>{{organization_name}}</strong> and <strong>{{signer_name}}</strong>, hereby referred to as "Adopter."</p>\n\n    <p>Adopter agrees to adopt and care for the following equine for the purpose of providing a safe, healthy, and loving environment for the horse and will abide by all anti-cruelty laws of the state in which the animal will reside.</p>\n\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group full-width">\n            A. Name of horse:\n            <div class="input-box">{{horse_name}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            B. Age of horse/DOB:\n            <div class="input-box">{{horse_age}}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            C. Gender of horse:\n            <div class="input-box">{{horse_gender}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            D. Approximate Height:\n            <div class="input-box">{{horse_height}}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            E. Breed:\n            <div class="input-box">{{horse_breed}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-group full-width">\n        F. Description (brands, scars, tattoos, disabilities):\n        <div class="input-box">{{horse_description}}</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <p class="warning-text">\n        I, as the adopter of this equine, agree to NEVER, UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES, SELL, REHOME, GIVE AWAY, LET ANY PERSON BORROW, the said equine, at any time during the equine's life. EQUINE MUST BE RETURNED TO {{organization_name}} IMMEDIATELY.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class="signature-block">\n        Signature of Adopter\n        <img src="{{signature_image_url}}" alt="Signature" class="signature-image">\n        <div class="meta-info">Signed by: {{signer_name}} | IP: {{signed_ip}} | {{signed_timestamp}}</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>Required Level of Care</h2>\n    <p>The level of care of Adoption Horses should be the highest standards in the industry.</p>\n    \n    <h3>Required Veterinarian Care:</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Spring Inoculations:</strong> Eastern/Western Encephalitis, Tetanus, Rabies, and any others recommended by your vet.</li>\n        <li><strong>Annual Dental Care:</strong> (floating of teeth).</li>\n        <li><strong>Fall Inoculations:</strong> Influenza, Rhino, and any others recommended by your vet, and dental (may be combined).</li>\n        <li><strong>Deworming &amp; Hoof Care:</strong> Rotated de-worming as recommended by Veterinarian. Hoof care every 8 weeks.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Housing &amp; Environment:</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Horses are herd animals and are happiest when they have an equine companion. Horses will not be adopted out to a home without another horse.</li>\n        <li>The horse must have daily turnout of no less than 8 hours unless there is dangerous weather.</li>\n        <li>The horse must have at least one acre of clear-cut pasture with some shade per horse.</li>\n        <li>The horse must have at least a 3-sided shed in the paddock to block wind and bad weather. Preference is given to anyone that has an individual stall for each horse.</li>\n        <li>Your pasture must have acceptable fencing.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>Feeding &amp; Maintenance:</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Each horse must receive the required daily feed allowance plus plenty of good quality grass or hay.</li>\n        <li>Each horse must be offered no less than 15 gallons of fresh water each day, either in buckets or in regularly cleaned out water troughs. A stagnant pond or creek is not an acceptable primary source of water.</li>\n        <li>The horse must be trimmed or shod by a qualified farrier, going no longer than every 8 weeks.</li>\n        <li>Miniature horses should not hold more than 50 pounds of body weight.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Adopter Responsibilities</h2>\n    <p>Adopter agrees to contact <strong>{{organization_name}}</strong> for the following reasons:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>If Adopter can no longer care for the horse.</li>\n        <li>If the horse dies.</li>\n        <li>If the horse becomes seriously injured or ill.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>A vet is to be called for any illness and any serious injury. If a diagnosis of injury or illness cannot be treated due to financial reasons, the horse must be returned to {{organization_name}} immediately.</p>\n    \n    <p>It is advised that the adopter pay for a vet check if you have any questions prior to the horse departing {{organization_name}}. All costs upon departing and while away are to be paid by the Adopter, even return transportation. {{organization_name}} is not responsible for any accidents or injuries either to the horse or adopter after leaving our facility.</p>\n\n    <p>The adopted horse can be returned to {{organization_name}} at any time, regardless of reason, if you can no longer provide a loving, forever home. <strong>The adoption donation will not be refunded.</strong></p>\n\n    <div class="field-row" style="background-color: #eee; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">\n        <div class="full-width">\n            <strong>* Adoption Donation:</strong> Concurrent with the Signature of this agreement, Adopter has paid to {{organization_name}} a non-refundable adoption donation in the amount of:\n            <br><br>\n            <div class="input-box" style="width: 150px; display: inline-block;">{{adoption_fee}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <p>Full payment of the adoption donation is required before removal of the adopted horse from {{organization_name}} facility.</p>\n\n    <p class="warning-text">Prohibited Uses: ADOPTER AGREES THAT UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHALL THE ADOPTED HORSE BE USED FOR BREEDING PURPOSES.</p>\n\n    <div class="signature-block">\n        Signature of Adopter\n        <img src="{{signature_image_url}}" alt="Signature" class="signature-image">\n        <div class="meta-info">Signed by: {{signer_name}} | IP: {{signed_ip}} | {{signed_timestamp}}</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>Disclosure and Release</h2>\n    <p>Adopter represents, warrants, and declares that Adopter is aware of the following in connection with his/her adoption of the adopted horse from {{organization_name}}:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>A. That horses are different from human beings in the response to human actions.</li>\n        <li>B. That the actions of horses are often unpredictable.</li>\n        <li>C. That horses should be closely and carefully supervised when they are with or around children.</li>\n        <li>D. That the Adopted horse's behavior may change after it leaves {{organization_name}}.</li>\n        <li>E. That horses in a new environment may act differently and Adopter will afford the horse adequate time (at least 7 days) to acclimate to its new environment before being ridden, to the extent the horse is rideable.</li>\n        <li>F. That any statements made by {{organization_name}} regarding the adopted horse are merely opinions and are made solely as a courtesy, and in no way amount to claims, representations, or warranties as to temperament, health, or mental disposition.</li>\n        <li>G. Adopter releases, discharges, indemnifies and holds {{organization_name}} harmless from and against any and all claims, liens, damages, losses, and causes of action which may be asserted by Adopter and all third parties for injury or damage to all persons, property, or thing whatsoever caused directly or indirectly by the adopted horse.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class="signature-block">\n        Signature of Adopter\n        <img src="{{signature_image_url}}" alt="Signature" class="signature-image">\n        <div class="meta-info">Signed by: {{signer_name}} | IP: {{signed_ip}} | {{signed_timestamp}}</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2>Final Agreement</h2>\n    <p>{{organization_name}} holds the right to recover the horse(s) if ever abused, abandoned, neglected, starved, or mistreated, etc., in any way. The Adopter agrees to abide by the Required Level of Care, or the horse can and will be recovered by {{organization_name}} at any time. {{organization_name}} reserves the right to visit the equine at one month, six months, and one year with 48 hours advance notice to the adopter.</p>\n\n    <p><strong>I have read and understand the conditions of the Adoption Contract and agree to uphold the highest level of care for my Adopted horse.</strong></p>\n\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            First Name\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_name}}</div> </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            Date\n            <div class="input-box">{{date}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group full-width">\n            Street Address\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_address_street}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group full-width">\n            Address Line 2\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_address_line2}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            City\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_city}}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            State / Province\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_state}}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            Postal / Zip Code\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_zip}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class="field-row">\n        <div class="field-group">\n            Phone Number\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_phone}}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class="field-group">\n            Email\n            <div class="input-box">{{signer_email}}</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class="signature-block">\n        Final Signature\n        <img src="{{signature_image_url}}" alt="Signature" class="signature-image">\n        <div class="meta-info">\n            Digital Signature: {{signature_image_url}}<br>\n            Timestamp: {{signed_timestamp}}<br>\n            IP Address: {{signed_ip}}\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n	t	t	f	\N	2026-01-19 20:40:18.483677	2026-01-19 20:40:18.483677	c9f80047-4456-426b-9ee8-d1b15f7301b9	[{"id": "97a55f48-01eb-4018-83f3-c8ee66a9b474", "name": "Horse Name", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "horse_name", "required": false}, {"id": "e8558837-8bee-4a80-bf2c-d7b29e6c542f", "name": "Horse Age", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "horse_age", "required": false}, {"id": "0fe42a99-23bd-4b03-85db-de906f5d05e6", "name": "Horse Gender", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "horse_gender", "required": false}, {"id": "11f4d9a5-c248-4efd-bb1b-4699285526b5", "name": "Horse Height", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "horse_height", "required": false}, {"id": "c8f0f218-63b3-4a0f-813d-09221bdef264", "name": "Horse breed", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "horse_breed", "required": false}, {"id": "f37f760a-5d61-4c22-8130-25453238d37a", "name": "Horse description", "type": "textarea", "fieldKey": "horse_description", "required": false}, {"id": "4a542cca-b8e4-4b74-90aa-d80d6574fe92", "name": "Street Address", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "signer_address_street", "required": false}, {"id": "4a1d5a2d-2a64-4037-9c22-3ca308a09586", "name": "Address (line 2)", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "signer_address_line2", "required": false}, {"id": "14df0731-81b6-49c6-aa53-c23fc1e0a3d8", "name": "City", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "signer_city", "required": false}, {"id": "c878e9ad-80b4-4d14-b528-0ee4f5d54f2d", "name": "State/Province", "type": "text", "fieldKey": "signer_state", "required": false}, {"id": "cd3681f7-9740-44c5-a215-7274607148c8", "name": "Postal / zip code", "type": "number", "fieldKey": "signer_zip", "required": false}]	template	[]	
