61e3ba2f-022c-4cad-b874-f2c8fb087e4e	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	adoption	Sumitting this application does not mean you are commiting to a dog, nor does it guarantee you will get that dog.  It is simply a tool we use to help both you and us identify a good potential match for your family and lifestyle.\n\nA successful adoption depends on selecting the right dog for your household and a good understanding of the dog's needs and care requirements.  Please help us with this process by answering the following questions fully & completely. THANK YOU!	2025-12-27 23:38:33.294521	2025-12-27 23:38:33.294521	f
3d87ba6b-2753-4447-b7f0-2e96f912e8c8	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	foster	Want to foster?\nWould you like to foster a pet for a time being, or until he/she gets adopted? Haseya’s provides all food, beds, bowls, leashes, collars, kennels and treats as well as pays for all vetting. All you have to do is bring them to their vet appointments and give them all the love they so desperately need.\n\n If so, fill out the form below. 	2025-12-27 23:49:52.655342	2025-12-27 23:49:52.655342	f
