31262b3a-87db-4c72-b141-eaf42fedcfeb	3a4c2321-6a54-41a4-acf3-a7f2ffe0c051	surrender	Please read carefully!\n\n**BEGINNING AUGUST 2024 ALL SURRENDERS ARE REQUIRED TO COMPLETE 4 HOURS OF VOLUNTEERING AT THE SHELTER BEFORE YOUR ANIMAL IS SURRENDERED. NO EXCEPTIONS!\n\n** Haseya's New Beginning is a Dogs Only Rescue **\n\nBefore choosing to surrender your animal, please make sure you have checked into any and all options. Haseya’s New Beginning does offer dog food, cat food, cat litter, and supplies to people who are struggling to keep their pets. Remember that your pet will be coming into a shelter atmosphere. Although we strive for the best care possible, your pet will be alone most of the day and be in a building full of other dogs, which can be quite scary. Please consider rehoming your pet or fostering your pet until we can make adoption or rescue transfers arrangements.  If none of these options help you, please fill out our surrender request form. Homeless animals are our top priority, so depending on room availability, it may take a couple of weeks or even months to be accepted.\n\nSURRENDER REQUEST FORM\nWhen you submit this form, we will contact you if and when we are able to intake your dog. By submitting this form, you agree we are allowed to forward any information to other rescues that we think may be able to help.	2025-12-28 16:17:01.767912	2026-01-20 00:39:58.51	f
